  "description": "Everything is kinda ruined, so good luck or something.\n\nIn Crupt, each Wave will present you with a new enemy to fight and a different building to restore.\n\nWith every Wave you conquer, you'll expand your arsenal along with your social circle as you bring back everyone and everything.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• 20 Waves with a new enemy to accompany each Wave\n\n• A big boss thing every 5 Waves\n\n• A building (or part of a building) to repair each Wave\n\n• A new wacky character to talk to for every building repaired\n\n• Resource management elements let you experience the wonders of semi-passive income\n\n• Like 50 Items to buy\n\n• Post-game content\n\n• Achievements, if you're into that sorta thing\n\n• A pretty cool Bestiary\n\n• Original soundtrack and (mostly) cute pixel art graphics\n\n• Meet?\n\n• Plenty of Bundles\n\n• Chups, Flumps, Squmps, and even Lubs\n\n• Oh, and this guy:",
